lord\'s ♣K. This forces them to use a 2 or Joker if they want to continue, while preserving my ♠2 as a crucial control card for the endgame. My teammate has already passed, indicating they cannot help here, so I need to apply pressure on the landlord. Using the Ace is economical - it beats the King without wasting my most powerful single card (the 2).\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♠A"]}'}
